Output nodes: {{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.output_nodes }}

Complete the BLANK_MODEL_TEMPLATE by inserting intermediate layers that are valid under ARCHITECTURE_SPEC, compatible with INPUT_SHAPE, and consistent with OUTPUT_ACTIVATION.
Use SELECTED_BLUEPRINT as the primary design guidance, but obey ARCHITECTURE_SPEC if there is any conflict.

Validate the completed model JSON using the validate-model-architecture tool until it returns valid == true.

When validation succeeds, return exactly one JSON object with the following top-level fields:

{
  "model_name": {
    "type": "string",
    "description": "Human-readable model name; will be stored in the 'name' TEXT column."
  },
  "nn_taxonomy": {
    "type": "object",
    "description": "Fully validated model JSON; stored as JSONB in 'nn_taxonomy'."
  },
  "extra_meta": {
    "type": "object",
    "description": "Optional metadata/comments; stored as JSONB in 'extra_meta'."
  }
}

You must not output anything other than the final JSON object described above.

This is the request from the overarching Orchestrator Agent:{{ $('When Executed by Another Workflow').item.json.chatInput }}
"
